#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:100
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of OpenLDAP"
msgstr "Instalação do OpenLDAP"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:113
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you only need to install the client side <command>ldap*</command> "
"binaries, corresponding man pages, libraries and header files (referred to "
"as a <quote>client-only</quote> install), issue these commands instead of "
"the following ones (no test suite available):"
msgstr ""
"Se você precisar instalar somente os binários "
"&quot;<command>ldap*</command>&quot; do lado cliente, páginas de manual, "
"bibliotecas e arquivos de cabeçalho correspondentes (referidos como "
"instalação <quote>client-only</quote>), [então] emita estes comandos, em vez"
" dos seguintes (nenhuma suíte de teste disponível):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:119
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../openldap-&openldap-version;-consolidated-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"autoconf &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr     \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc \\\n"
"            --disable-static  \\\n"
"            --enable-dynamic  \\\n"
"            --disable-debug   \\\n"
"            --disable-slapd   &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"make depend &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../openldap-&openldap-version;-consolidated-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"autoconf &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr     \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc \\\n"
"            --disable-static  \\\n"
"            --enable-dynamic  \\\n"
"            --disable-debug   \\\n"
"            --disable-slapd   &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"make depend &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:133
#, xml-text
msgid "Then, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Em seguida, como o(a) usante <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:136
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:141
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There should be a dedicated user and group to take control of the "
"<command>slapd</command> daemon after it is started. Issue the following "
"commands as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Deveria existir um(a) usante e um grupo dedicado(a) para assumir o controle "
"do processo de segundo plano <command>slapd</command> depois de ele ser "
"iniciado. Emita os seguintes comandos como o(a) usante <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:147
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 83 ldap &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd  -c \"OpenLDAP Daemon Owner\" \\\n"
"         -d /var/lib/openldap -u 83 \\\n"
"         -g ldap -s /bin/false ldap</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 83 ldap &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd  -c \"Proprietário(a) do Processo de Segundo Plano OpenLDAP\" \\\n"
"         -d /var/lib/openldap -u 83 \\\n"
"         -g ldap -s /bin/false ldap</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:153
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>OpenLDAP</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>OpenLDAP</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:157
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../openldap-&openldap-version;-consolidated-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"autoconf &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr         \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc     \\\n"
"            --localstatedir=/var  \\\n"
"            --libexecdir=/usr/lib \\\n"
"            --disable-static      \\\n"
"            --disable-debug       \\\n"
"            --with-tls=openssl    \\\n"
"            --with-cyrus-sasl     \\\n"
"            --without-systemd     \\\n"
"            --enable-dynamic      \\\n"
"            --enable-crypt        \\\n"
"            --enable-spasswd      \\\n"
"            --enable-slapd        \\\n"
"            --enable-modules      \\\n"
"            --enable-rlookups     \\\n"
"            --enable-backends=mod \\\n"
"            --disable-sql         \\\n"
"            --disable-wt          \\\n"
"            --enable-overlays=mod &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"make depend &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../openldap-&openldap-version;-consolidated-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"autoconf &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr         \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc     \\\n"
"            --localstatedir=/var  \\\n"
"            --libexecdir=/usr/lib \\\n"
"            --disable-static      \\\n"
"            --disable-debug       \\\n"
"            --with-tls=openssl    \\\n"
"            --with-cyrus-sasl     \\\n"
"            --without-systemd     \\\n"
"            --enable-dynamic      \\\n"
"            --enable-crypt        \\\n"
"            --enable-spasswd      \\\n"
"            --enable-slapd        \\\n"
"            --enable-modules      \\\n"
"            --enable-rlookups     \\\n"
"            --enable-backends=mod \\\n"
"            --disable-sql         \\\n"
"            --disable-wt          \\\n"
"            --enable-overlays=mod &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"make depend &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:184
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The tests are fragile, and errors may cause the tests to abort prior to "
"finishing. Some errors may happen due to timing problems.  The tests take "
"around an hour, and the time is CPU independent due to delays in the tests. "
"On most systems, the tests will run up to the <filename>test065-proxyauth "
"for mdb</filename> test.  To test the results, issue: <command>make "
"test</command>."
msgstr ""
"Os testes são frágeis e erros podem fazer com que os testes abortem antes de"
" finalizarem. Alguns erros podem ocorrer devido a problemas de temporização."
" Os testes duram cerca de uma hora e o tempo independe da CPU devido a "
"atrasos nos testes. Na maioria dos sistemas, os testes executarão até o "
"teste <filename>test065-proxyauth for mdb</filename>. Para testar os "
"resultados, emita: <command>make test</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:193
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:196
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"sed -e \"s/\\.la/.so/\" -i /etc/openldap/slapd.{conf,ldif}{,.default} &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -dm700 -o ldap -g ldap /var/lib/openldap     &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -dm700 -o ldap -g ldap /etc/openldap/slapd.d &amp;&amp;\n"
"chmod   -v    640     /etc/openldap/slapd.{conf,ldif}   &amp;&amp;\n"
"chown   -v  root:ldap /etc/openldap/slapd.{conf,ldif}   &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -dm755 /usr/share/doc/openldap-&openldap-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp      -vfr      doc/{drafts,rfc,guide} \\\n"
"                  /usr/share/doc/openldap-&openldap-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"sed -e \"s/\\.la/.so/\" -i /etc/openldap/slapd.{conf,ldif}{,.default} &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -dm700 -o ldap -g ldap /var/lib/openldap    &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -dm700 -o ldap -g ldap /etc/openldap/slapd.d &amp;&amp;\n"
"chmod   -v    640     /etc/openldap/slapd.{conf,ldif}   &amp;&amp;\n"
"chown   -v  root:ldap /etc/openldap/slapd.{conf,ldif}   &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -dm755 /usr/share/doc/openldap-&openldap-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp      -vfr      doc/{drafts,rfc,guide} \\\n"
"                  /usr/share/doc/openldap-&openldap-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:213
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:219
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-debug</parameter>: This switch disables the debugging "
"code in <application>OpenLDAP</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-debug</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita o código de "
"depuração no &quot;<application>OpenLDAP</application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:224
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-dynamic</parameter>: This switch forces the "
"<application>OpenLDAP</application> libraries to be dynamically linked to "
"the executable programs."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-dynamic</parameter>: Essa chave força as bibliotecas do "
"&quot;<application>OpenLDAP</application>&quot; a serem vinculadas "
"dinamicamente aos aplicativos executáveis."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:230
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-crypt</parameter>: This switch enables using <ulink "
"role='man' url='&man;crypt.3'>crypt(3)</ulink> passwords."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-crypt</parameter>: Essa chave habilita usar senhas do "
"<ulink role='man' url='&man;crypt.3'>crypt(3)</ulink>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:235
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-spasswd</parameter>: This switch enables "
"<application>SASL</application> password verification."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-spasswd</parameter>: Essa chave habilita a verificação "
"de senha do &quot;<application>SASL</application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:240
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-modules</parameter>: This switch enables dynamic module "
"support."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-modules</parameter>: Essa chave habilita o suporte a "
"módulo dinâmico."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:245
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-rlookups</parameter>: This switch enables reverse "
"lookups of client hostnames."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-rlookups</parameter>: Essa chave habilita pesquisas "
"reversas de nomes de dispositivos clientes."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:250
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-backends</parameter>: This switch enables all available "
"backends."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-backends</parameter>: Essa chave habilita todas as "
"estruturas de retaguarda disponíveis."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:255
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-overlays</parameter>: This switch enables all available "
"overlays."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-overlays</parameter>: Essa chave habilita todas as "
"sobreposições disponíveis."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:260
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-sql</parameter>: This switch explicitly disables the "
"SQL backend.  Omit this switch if a SQL server is installed and you are "
"going to use a SQL backend."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-sql</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita explicitamente a"
" estrutura &quot;SQL&quot; de retaguarda. Omita essa chave se um servidor "
"&quot;SQL&quot; estiver instalado e você for usar uma estrutura "
"&quot;SQL&quot; de retaguarda."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:266
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-wt</parameter>: This switch explicitly disables the "
"WiredTiger backend.  Omit this switch if WiredTiger is installed and you are"
" going to use a WiredTiger backend."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-wt</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita explicitamente a "
"estrutura &quot;WiredTiger&quot; de retaguarda. Omita essa chave se o "
"&quot;WiredTiger&quot; estiver instalado e você for usar uma estrutura "
"&quot;WiredTiger&quot; de retaguarda."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:272
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--without-systemd</parameter>: This switch explicitly disables "
"the bundled systemd units from being installed. These units do not work "
"correctly because of configuration assumptions that are overridden by the "
"consolidated patch, and also do not install a working basic configuration "
"file like the BLFS systemd units provide."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--without-systemd</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita "
"explicitamente as unidades empacotadas do systemd de serem instaladas. Essas"
" unidades não funcionam corretamente devido a suposições de configuração que"
" são substituídas pelo remendo consolidado e também não instalam um arquivo "
"de configuração básica funcional como as unidades do systemd do BLFS "
"fornecem."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:280
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--libexecdir=/usr/lib</parameter>: This switch controls where the"
" <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/lib/openldap</filename> directory is "
"installed.  Everything in that directory is a library, so it belongs under "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/usr/lib</filename> instead of <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/libexec</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--libexecdir=/usr/lib</parameter>: Essa chave controla onde o "
"diretório &quot;<filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/lib/openldap</filename>&quot; está instalado. Tudo "
"nesse diretório é uma biblioteca, de forma que ele pertence a "
"&quot;<filename class=\"directory\">/usr/lib</filename>&quot; em vez de "
"&quot;<filename class=\"directory\">/usr/libexec</filename>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:288
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-slp</option>: This switch enables SLPv2 support. Use it if "
"you have installed <ulink url=\"http://www.openslp.org/\">OpenSLP</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-slp</option>: Essa chave habilita o suporte a "
"&quot;SLPv2&quot;. Use-a se você tiver instalado o &quot;<ulink "
"url=\"http://www.openslp.org/\">OpenSLP</ulink>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:294
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-versioning</option>: This switch disables symbol "
"versioning in the <application>OpenLDAP</application> libraries.  The "
"default is to have symbol versioning. Note that if you have built "
"applications using this package with symbol versioning, and remove the "
"symbols, the applications may fail to run."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-versioning</option>: Essa chave desabilita o versionamento"
" de símbolos nas bibliotecas do <application>OpenLDAP</application>. O "
"padrão é o de ter versionamento de símbolos. Observe que se você tiver "
"construído aplicativos usando esse pacote com versionamento de símbolos e "
"removeu os símbolos, os aplicativos possivelmente falhem na execução."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:303
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You can run <command>./configure --help</command> to see if there are other "
"switch you can pass to the <command>configure</command> command to enable "
"other options or dependency packages."
msgstr ""
"Você pode executar &quot;<command>./configure --help</command>&quot; para "
"ver se existe outra chave que você possa passar para o comando "
"&quot;<command>configure</command>&quot; para habilitar outras opções ou "
"pacotes de dependência."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/server/other/openldap.xml:310
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>install ...</command>, <command>chown ...</command>, and "
"<command>chmod ...</command>: Having slapd configuration files and ldap "
"databases in /var/lib/openldap readable by anyone is a SECURITY ISSUE, "
"especially since a file stores the admin password in PLAIN TEXT. That's why "
"mode 640 and root:ldap ownership were used. The owner is root, so only root "
"can modify the file, and group is ldap, so that the group which owns slapd "
"daemon could read but not modify the file in case of a security breach."
msgstr ""
"&quot;<command>install ...</command>&quot;, &quot;<command>chown "
"...</command>&quot; e &quot;<command>chmod ...</command>&quot;: Ter arquivos"
" de configuração do &quot;slapd&quot; e bases de dados &quot;ldap&quot; em "
"&quot;/var/lib/openldap&quot; legíveis por qualquer pessoa é um PROBLEMA DE "
"SEGURANÇA, especialmente porque um arquivo armazena a senha do(a) "
"administrador(a) em TEXTO SIMPLES. É por isso que o modo 640 e a "
"titularidade de propriedade &quot;root:ldap&quot; foi usado. O proprietário "
"é o(a) &quot;root&quot;, de forma que somente o(a) &quot;root&quot; consegue"
" modificar o arquivo, e o grupo é o &quot;ldap&quot;, de forma que o grupo "
"que titulariza o processo de segundo plano &quot;slapd&quot; consiga ler, "
"mas não modificar o arquivo em caso de uma brecha de segurança."

